{
  "_comment": "Who may do what in a shared conversation — the one table both sides check (ADR-0149 shared chat, ADR-0222 files.share, files.readLive, files.writeLive). crates/cognia-collab-server/src/chat.rs (authoritative) and lib/collab/session-permissions.ts (what the client greys out) both test against it. clientOnlyActions are decided on the client alone and have no server variant. A case is allowed when the role lists the action, or the approver overlay covers it; a guest never gets a guestDenied action.",
